---
pagination:
  data: pages.about.locales
  size: 1
  alias: locale
permalink: "{{ locale.permalink }}"
---
{#
  TAQATHON - ABOUT PAGE TEMPLATE (src/pages/about.njk)
  ------------------------------------------------------------
  Built as part of Phase 3's nav restructure — the new "About"
  dropdown in navbar.njk needed a real destination page, not just an
  empty menu label. Two stacked sections, association first then
  Taqathon itself, per explicit instruction — a simple content page,
  no forms/loops needed.

  PLACEHOLDER/DRAFT CONTENT (Phase 3, 2026-08-11): every body
  paragraph is a draft stand-in — see about.ar.json / about.en.json's
  "_comment" field. The "Official Status" sub-section is flagged with
  extra care there: don't let anyone (including a future editing
  session) casually fill it in with invented legal/registration
  details — that specifically has to come from the Association.
#}
{% extends "layouts/base.njk" %}
{% block pageStyle %}{% endblock %}

{% block content %}
<div class="py-5">
  <div class="container" style="max-width:860px;">

    <div class="text-center mb-4">
      <div class="icon-circle mx-auto mb-3">
        <i class="bi {{ locale.content.hero.icon }}"></i>
      </div>
      <h1 class="h4 {{ locale.content.hero.headingClass }} mb-0">{{ locale.content.hero.heading }}</h1>
    </div>

    <div class="card card-lite rounded-2xl p-4 mb-4">
      <h5 class="fw-semibold mb-3">{{ locale.content.association.heading }}</h5>
      <p class="mb-3">{{ locale.content.association.bodyPlaceholder }}</p>
      <div class="border-top pt-3">
        <h6 class="fw-semibold mb-2">{{ locale.content.association.statusLabel }}</h6>
        <p class="text-secondary mb-0">{{ locale.content.association.statusPlaceholder }}</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card card-lite rounded-2xl p-4 mb-4">
      <h5 class="fw-semibold mb-3">{{ locale.content.taqathon.heading }}</h5>
      <p class="mb-4">{{ locale.content.taqathon.bodyPlaceholder }}</p>

      <div class="row g-4">
        <div class="col-md-6">
          <h6 class="fw-semibold mb-2">{{ locale.content.taqathon.missionHeading }}</h6>
          <p class="mb-0">{{ locale.content.taqathon.missionPlaceholder }}</p>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-6">
          <h6 class="fw-semibold mb-2">{{ locale.content.taqathon.visionHeading }}</h6>
          <p class="mb-0">{{ locale.content.taqathon.visionPlaceholder }}</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="text-center">
      <p class="text-secondary mb-2">{{ locale.content.ctaLabel }}</p>
      <a class="btn btn-brand btn-lg" href="{{ locale.content.ctaButtonHref }}">{{ locale.content.ctaButtonLabel }}</a>
    </div>

  </div>
</div>
{% endblock %}
